    'Planned or hypothetical trades ("살까?", "사려고", "내일 살까 봐") are question, never buy, sell or other. A message that reports more than one trade is question too (the answer will ask for one trade per message). The bot may save an other message as the reason for the last trade, so use other only for the cases listed under it.',
